# Line endings — settled once, for the whole repo.
#
# This repo lives on a Windows drive but is read by Linux tooling and served by
# GitHub Pages. Before this file existed, every checkout rewrote all 66 text
# files to CRLF, so `git status` showed the entire repo as modified and every
# real diff drowned in line-ending churn. `/dsf:check` reads diffs; noise there
# is not cosmetic.
#
# LF in the repository AND in the working tree, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never normalized, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
